---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PlatformTable from '../components/PlatformTable.astro'
import WaitlistForm from '../components/WaitlistForm.astro'
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="下载 Dex AGENT — 内测预约"
  description="Dex AGENT 内测预约。当前安装包尚未发布，留下邮箱获取内测通知。"
  current="/download/"
  schema
>
  <section class="dl2-hero">
    <div class="container dl2-hero-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">DOWNLOAD / v0.2 / ORDER FORM 001</p>
        <h1>把回路<br />装进你的桌面。</h1>
        <p>Dex AGENT 正在内测准备中。留下邮箱，安装包与配置说明准备好后，我们会联系你。</p>
        <div class="actions" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;margin-top:28px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#waitlist">预约内测</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/#fig-01">阅读图注</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="order-card" aria-label="版本状态">
        <span class="stamp2">WAITLIST OPEN</span>
        <div class="orow"><span>VERSION</span><b>v0.2</b></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>CHANNEL</span><span class="wait"><i></i>内测准备中</span></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>PLATFORM</span><b>WIN / MAC / LINUX</b></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>DISTRIBUTION</span><b>未发布安装包</b></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>DATA</span><b>LOCAL-FIRST</b></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dl2-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dl2-head"><div class="fig">FIG. D1</div><h2>选择你的平台。</h2><p>安装包尚未发布。预约后，内测开放时我们会通过邮件联系你。</p></div>
      <PlatformTable />
      <div class="dl2-note"><i></i><p>当前版本仍在开发中。内测开放时，计划提供桌面安装包、本地运行时配置说明与版本更新通知；具体时间以邮件通知为准。</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dl2-body" id="waitlist">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dl2-head"><div class="fig">FIG. D2</div><h2>预约内测</h2><p>不需要介绍信，也不需要简历。留下邮箱和平台，内测开放时通知你。</p></div>
      <div class="wait2">
        <div>
          <h3>留下一个能联系到你的地址。</h3>
          <p>只用于内测通知，不进入营销名单。当前表单使用 mailto: 占位，站点接入真实表单端点后会直接提交。</p>
          <div class="dl2-note" style="margin-top:22px"><i></i><p>邮件占位：<span class="mono">hello@example.com</span><br />替换位置见 README。</p></div>
          <div class="get-list">
            <div><b>01 / PACKAGE</b><span>桌面安装包</span></div>
            <div><b>02 / SETUP</b><span>本地运行时配置说明</span></div>
            <div><b>03 / UPDATES</b><span>版本更新通知</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <WaitlistForm />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dl2-body" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dl2-head"><div class="fig">FIG. D3</div><h2>常见问题</h2><p>关于产品身份、数据、平台与内测。</p></div>
      <Faq />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
